# Meeting notes typed in one go: Enter for each next block, Tab and Shift+Tab while editing, Ctrl+B bolds the word at the caret, a dash makes a task.
file <<END
Meetings:
	Standup 1 Oct
		All good
END
keys G gp o
type Planning 8 Oct
keys <Enter> <Tab>
type Attendees: Ann, Bob
keys <Enter>
type Decision ship on Friday
keys <C-b> <Enter>
type - Ann writes the notes
keys <Enter> <Tab>
type by Monday
keys <Enter> <S-Tab> <S-Tab>
type Next steps
keys <Esc>
see ▌   - Next steps
see         - by Monday
quit
saved <<END
Meetings:
	Standup 1 Oct
		All good
	Planning 8 Oct
		Attendees: Ann, Bob
		Decision ship on **Friday**
		- Ann writes the notes
			- by Monday
	- Next steps
END
